        <div class="bio-block__text" id="bio-short">Pastor Bola Akinlabi is the Global Co-Lead Pastor of The Elevation Church, which she co-founded with her husband, Pastor Godman Akinlabi, in 2010. A former treasury and finance leader and Certified John Maxwell Leadership Trainer, she leads Jewels, TEC’s women’s ministry, and convenes the Made for More Conference. She is the mother of two daughters.</div>
