      <div class="bio-block reveal" data-delay="1">
        <div class="bio-block__head"><h3 style="font-size:1.5rem">Full bio <span class="muted" style="font-family:var(--f-sans);font-size:.85rem">· 220 words</span></h3><button class="copy-btn" type="button" data-copy="bio-long">Copy</button></div>
        <div class="bio-block__text" id="bio-long">Pastor Bola Akinlabi is the Global Co-Lead Pastor of The Elevation Church, where her visionary leadership, strategic insight and commitment to people continue to shape ministry across nations. She is known for combining spiritual depth with exceptional leadership, building strong foundations that help individuals, families and communities thrive.

Before dedicating herself fully to ministry, Pastor Bola served at senior level within a leading financial institution, with over a decade of experience in treasury and financial management. She holds a Bachelor’s degree in Economics from Ahmadu Bello University, Zaria, and a Postgraduate Diploma in Financial Strategy from the University of Oxford.

A Certified John Maxwell Leadership Trainer, she is passionate about developing leaders and equipping people to reach their potential. She is the visionary behind Jewels, the women’s ministry of The Elevation Church, and the convener of the annual Made for More Conference, which has helped thousands of women discover purpose and embrace their calling in Lagos, London and Toronto.

A sought-after speaker, mentor and leader, Pastor Bola considers her family her greatest calling. She is the wife of Pastor Godman Akinlabi and the proud mother of two daughters.</div>
